  "instance_name": "audience_id",
  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target community for this meme is individuals who are familiar with or sensitive to gendered stereotypes in service industries, particularly those who recognize or have experienced the expectation for women to perform cheerfulness as emotional labor. The meme is designed to resonate with people who understand the performative nature of smiles in customer service roles and who may find humor or critique in the misogynous stereotype that women’s emotional expression is inauthentic or excessive. The audience likely includes those who are aware of or have encountered the 'performative smile' trope, and who may appreciate or be provoked by the sarcastic commentary on gendered expectations in service work.",
